>  	[DDP_COMPONENT_OVL1]	= { MTK_DISP_OVL,	1, NULL },
> +	[DDP_COMPONENT_OVL0_2L]	= { MTK_DISP_OVL,	2, NULL },

If ovl_2l is different than ovl, I think it's better to add new type for
ovl_2l.

Regards,
